<article class="ltx_document ltx_fleqn">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Evaluating and Improving LLM-based Competitive Program Generation</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_journal"><span class="ltx_note_name">Journal: </span>Information and Software Technology</span></span></span>
